  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>A plain gold band that is warm at dawn and cool by dusk, every day, wherever it is kept. The engraving inside it is a single line that runs around the ring and meets itself.</p><p><strong>Second Dawn.</strong> When you die while wearing this ring, you return to life at the start of your next turn with all your Hit Points, standing, and every condition on you ends. The ring then turns gray and cold, and it regains this power at the seventh dawn after.</p><p><strong>What Was Seen.</strong> Each time the ring brings its wearer back, the wearer returns knowing one true thing they could not have known: a name, a place, or the hour of a death not their own. The GM chooses it, and it is always something that matters.</p>",
      "chat": ""
    },
